  m_text: 'A paranoid, tired individual, the Barkeep has spent the last few centuries
    mostly alone, tending his bar, watching as society collapses around him.


    Due
    to almost nobody traveling anymore, the Barkeep can spend years without any visitors.


    Most
    of humanity has been reduced to lunatic raiders and paranoid scrappers, the Barkeep
    is is still happy to serve the rare drifter, considering the rarity of such aquantenceship.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
