      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Once an ordinary person, the Marauder has lost everything.


    His memories,
    his name, his mind...


    But he refuses to lose his Death.


    He knows
    exactly how to get it back.


    If some scientist can bloody murder Death?


    Then
    I can sure as ''ell murder Life.'
